## 🔄 Interoperability & Handoffs

* **Parity with `bash-posix-automation`:** Maintain identical CLI argument behaviors (`--help`, `--dry-run`, `--verbose`) across paired scripts.
* **Handoff to `win32-systems-engineering`:** When complex logic exceeds scripting and requires native C++ services or DLL hooks.
* **Handoff to `csharp-dotnet-engineering`:** For building standalone compiled utilities when PowerShell startup latency is unacceptable.\n
